{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2025-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1761955200, "end_date": 1762559999, "month_true_total": 455, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:48:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "208641634", "author": {"steamid": "76561198232651680", "personaname": "ShadeHunter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198232651680/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1893, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 294, "last_played": 1768435956, "avatar": "d69454cc0c167d69cd969329b2c2890ec20d688e"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game", "timestamp_created": 1762532542, "timestamp_updated": 1762532542, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.429447829723358154", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208640843", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986510997", "personaname": "Tragic Notepad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197986510997/", "num_games_owned": 1032, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 37773, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36909, "last_played": 1765846354, "avatar": "d14379474767a66d8cfb73a0b85f75547a6c76cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "There are a lot of great things about the game, but unfortunately too many terrible choices drag the game down so hard. \r\n\r\nExtremely greedy monetization such as the colaboration skins. $80 for all the Nier Automata skins, $35 for the Bayonetta skins, Full battle pass price for a tiny little sword pass that was only around for around a month or two with a quarter of the items in a normal pass. \r\n\r\nA poor obsession with making all new content harder and enemies more spongier than the last content make the game continually less fun and makes more of the characters less viable.\r\n\r\nAn extreme amount of farming for materials to absurd degrees. Doing anything in the Axion Plains made me groan as you had to complete a mission to get a small chance at receiving a box that had a small chance at containing the item you needed. The newest update includes a mission that only gives you around 5-10 of a mat that's needed for the new Descendant and gun. However, you will need a grand total of 1050 of this material for the character and for a fully ascended gun, meaning you'd need to run the mission over 100 times to get everything you needed. \r\nThis ISN'T an issue of it being a farming game. \r\nThis IS an issue of not balancing drops. It being a farming game doesn't mean that its quality because we got more than 0 mats per run.\r\nFarming in Warframe feels like a minute jog in comparison to this game. \r\n\r\nIf you're thinking about trying it, DON'T. In it's current state, it's not worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1762531893, "timestamp_updated": 1762531893, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 289, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.913088023662567139", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 12}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "208637462", "author": {"steamid": "76561198153016065", "personaname": "ban152", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198153016065/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 118196, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 102351, "last_p